---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config/site';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description={`What ${SITE.name} is and how it works.`}>
  <article class="container prose">
    <p class="kicker">About</p>
    <h1>About {SITE.name}</h1>
    <p>
      India publishes a remarkable amount of public data, from national surveys and the census to budget
      documents, RBI releases and ministry dashboards. Most of it is hard to find and harder to read.
    </p>
    <p>
      {SITE.name} picks one question at a time, goes to the original source, and explains what the
      numbers show and what they don't. Each story cites its data sources and, where calculations are
      involved, describes the method.
    </p>
    <p>
      We are independent and not affiliated with any government body, political party or data publisher.
      If you spot an error, please tell us. Corrections are noted on the story.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
